{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39904","headline":"依韵和尚书再赠牡丹花 · 徐夤","name":"依韵和尚书再赠牡丹花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"烂银基地薄红妆，羞杀千花百卉芳。\n紫陌昔曾游寺看，朱门今在遶栏望。\n龙分夜雨资娇态，天与春风发好香。\n多着黄金何处买，轻桡挑过镜湖光。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39904.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39904","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}